	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c13r0501_clown_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケウッド！　そこは　たにんの
じんせいを　あじわえる　ばしょ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T09:44:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケウッド！　そこは　他人の
人生を　味わえる　場所！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T09:44:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
